---
import ButtonLink from "../../shared/ButtonLink.astro";
---

<section
  class="relative max-w-6xl px-6 sm:px-10 py-16 lg:py-24 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:justify-between overflow-hidden"
>
  <!-- Columna Izquierda: Información y Textos -->
  <div class="flex-1 text-center lg:text-left z-10 animate-fade-in-up">
    <!-- Badge Píldora -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-500/10 border border-fuchsia-500/25 text-xs font-semibold text-fuchsia-300 mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-400 animate-ping"></span>
      Soluciones Digitales de Alta Gama
    </div>

    <!-- Título Principal con Gradiente -->
    <h1 class="mb-6 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
      Convertimos tus ideas en
      <span class="block mt-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 via-fuchsia-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        experiencias tangibles
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtítulo -->
    <p class="mb-8 text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/70 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed font-light">
      En nuestro equipo, la innovación y la creatividad se fusionan para diseñar y desarrollar soluciones digitales personalizadas que destacan, convierten e impulsan tu negocio.
    </p>

    <!-- Botones de Acción -->
    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 z-20 relative w-full"
    >
      <ButtonLink
        href="/contacto"
        label="Conectémonos"
        btnClasses="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 via-fuchsia-500 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-600 hover:via-fuchsia-600 hover:to-cyan-600 text-white rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-fuchsia-500/20 hover:shadow-fuchsia-500/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:scale-102 active:scale-95 duration-300 transition-all border-none font-semibold text-lg"
      />
      <ButtonLink
        href="/contacto"
        label="Contáctanos"
        btnClasses="bg-space-800 border border-white/20 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-space-700 text-white rounded-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:scale-102 active:scale-95 duration-300 transition-all font-semibold text-lg shadow-xl"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Columna Derecha: Composición de Tarjetas Flotantes Visuales -->
  <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-[500px] h-[380px] sm:h-[420px] relative flex justify-center items-center select-none mt-12 lg:mt-0 scale-90 sm:scale-100">
    <!-- Fondo decorativo con brillo de orbe -->
    <div class="absolute w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500/10 to-blue-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <!-- Tarjeta 1: Panel de Analíticas (Cian) -->
    <div class="absolute top-[5%] left-[5%] w-[75%] rounded-2xl bg-space-850/80 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl p-5 shadow-2xl animate-float-slow">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 border-b border-white/5 pb-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/60"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/60"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/60"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-white/40 tracking-wider">analytics.vetekso.com</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-end gap-2 h-20">
        <div class="w-full bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-t h-[40%] hover:bg-cyan-500 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"></div>
        <div class="w-full bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-t h-[60%] hover:bg-cyan-500 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"></div>
        <div class="w-full bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-t h-[30%] hover:bg-cyan-500 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"></div>
        <div class="w-full bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-t h-[80%] hover:bg-cyan-500 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"></div>
        <div class="w-full bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-t h-[95%] hover:bg-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-4">
        <span class="text-xs text-white/50">Crecimiento Mensual</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          +48.3% <span class="text-[10px]">▲</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjeta 2: Interfaz de Usuario / Perfil (Fucsia) -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-[8%] right-[5%] w-[60%] rounded-2xl bg-space-850/80 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl p-5 shadow-2xl animate-float-medium" style="animation-delay: -2s;">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 to-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm text-white shadow-inner">
          VS
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="h-3 w-2/3 bg-white/20 rounded mb-1.5"></div>
          <div class="h-2 w-1/2 bg-white/10 rounded"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 flex gap-2">
        <div class="h-6 w-full rounded-lg bg-fuchsia-500/20 border border-fuchsia-500/30 text-[10px] text-fuchsia-300 font-semibold flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:bg-fuchsia-500/30 transition-all">
          Activar
        </div>
        <div class="h-6 w-1/3 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[10px] text-white/60 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
          Info
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjeta 3: Pequeño Widget de Código (Púrpura) -->
    <div class="absolute top-[45%] right-[10%] w-[45%] rounded-2xl bg-space-950/90 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl p-4 shadow-2xl animate-float-slow" style="animation-delay: -4s;">
      <div class="font-mono text-[9px] text-white/60 space-y-1.5">
        <div class="text-fuchsia-400">const <span class="text-blue-300">agency</span> = {"{"}</div>
        <div class="pl-3">name: <span class="text-green-300">'VETEK SO'</span>,</div>
        <div class="pl-3">speed: <span class="text-yellow-300">'maximum'</span>,</div>
        <div class="pl-3">quality: <span class="text-cyan-300">'premium'</span></div>
        <div>{"}"};</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
